---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
---

<Shell title="About — Jonas C. Morgner" current="about" intro>
  <p class="eyebrow about-eyebrow">About</p>

  <h1 class="h1">
    I make paintings about tension &mdash; between weight and air, structure and rupture.
  </h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Jonas C. Morgner (b. 1991) is a contemporary painter working primarily in
      acrylic on canvas. His practice moves between gestural abstraction and
      reduced color fields, treating each surface as a record of decisions made
      and undone.
    </p>
    <p>
      Working from his studio, Morgner builds compositions in layers, allowing
      earlier marks to resurface and interrupt the final image. The result is a
      body of work that feels both deliberate and unfinished &mdash; held in the
      moment just before resolution.
    </p>
    <p>
      His work has been shown in independent spaces and private collections.
      Recent series explore ochre and charcoal, monochrome rupture, and
      interlocking geometric form.
    </p>
  </div>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <dl class="meta">
    <div class="meta__cell">
      <dt>Studio</dt>
      <dd>Berlin, GER</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="meta__cell">
      <dt>Active since</dt>
      <dd>2025</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</Shell>

<style>
  .about-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--s-6);
  }

  .h1 {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-4);
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
  }

  .meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-3) var(--s-6);
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .meta__cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .meta dt {
    font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .meta dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--fs-nav);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .meta {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
